  <body>
    <h1>Rune</h1>
    <p>
      Runtime for multi-profile agents. Configure profiles and links with the CLI or web UI.
      Data lives under <code>.rune/</code>.
    </p>

    <h2>Monorepo</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><code>packages/engine</code> — sessions, profiles extension</li>
      <li><code>packages/api</code> — HTTP gateway</li>
      <li><code>packages/sdk</code> — types + HTTP client</li>
      <li><code>packages/cli</code> — <code>rune</code> binary</li>
      <li><code>apps/web</code> — React config UI</li>
      <li><code>apps/docs</code> — this site</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Quick start</h2>
    <pre><code>bun install
bun run rune serve
bun run dev:web
bun run rune profile create researcher --name Researcher</code></pre>

    <p>More docs will expand as the product solidifies.</p>
  </body>
</html>
